  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LVBC/EAC, 2006-2012, Regional Lake Victoria Partnership Fund - LVPF Monitoring &amp; Eval</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LVBC/EAC, 2006-2012,Regional partnerskapsfond f&#xf6;r Viktoriasj&#xf6;n</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbetet mellan EAC, dess medlemsl&#xe4;nder och givare &#xe4;r reglerat      genom ett partnerskapsavtal. En partnerskapsfond har etablerats f&#xf6;r   att st&#xf6;dja genomf&#xf6;rande av projekte relaterade till Lake Victoria     sj&#xf6;n. EAC och dess medlemsstater tillsammans med &#xd6;stafrikanska        utvecklingsbanken, V&#xe4;rldsbanken, Frankrike, Norge, Sverige och        Finland har skrivit under partnerskapsavtalet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The co-operation between EAC, its Partner states and development      partners is regulated through a Partnership Agreement.  A Partnership Fund is established to support the implementation of the programme.   EAC and its Partner States as well as the East African Development    Bank, the World Bank, France, Norway, Finland and Sweden are          signatories to the Partnership Agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
